Testing Procedure....

~# ifconfig eth0
eth0      Link encap:Ethernet  HWaddr 32:21:9e:4e:49:08  
          inet addr:10.3.12.214  Bcast:10.3.12.215  Mask:255.255.255.252
          inet6 addr: 2409:4070:4401:264a:3021:9eff:fe4e:4908/64 Scope:Global
          inet6 addr: fe80::3021:9eff:fe4e:4908/64 Scope:Link
          UP BROADCAST RUNNING PROMISC ALLMULTI MULTICAST  MTU:1422  Metric:1
          RX packets:1018 errors:0 dropped:0 overruns:0 frame:0
          TX packets:1195 errors:0 dropped:0 overruns:0 carrier:0
          collisions:0 txqueuelen:1000
